   "mark": "1",
   "text": "Thereisthestandardfunctor| MapCh \u0000C∗(∆•), −\u0001|: Ch →Top to topological spaces given by the Dold–Kan correspondence. While this functor does not send tensor product to Cartesian product, it does so up to a coherent natural transformation. The internal hom-objects of Ch thus give a topological enrichment.",
